  "objective": "Avoid full individual unit-frame chrome and threat refreshes on every notification in a group event burst.",
  "changes": [
    "Coalesce individual group and raid notifications into one next-turn callback. Roles and loot share an already-pending roster refresh. Standalone role and loot notifications keep immediate paint.",
    "Retain the full update methods, visibility decisions and protected-layout guards.",
    "Resolve the player subgroup with one roster-row lookup when the client supplies a readable raid index and subgroup. Preserve identity scan fallback.",
    "Restore the raid label when rejoining the same subgroup."
  ],
